~~~~~~~~ super_slim: fmt
= title # rubocop:disable Style/Example -- a reason
== safe_markup # unescaped
p = number # inline
p after a sibling
= wrap do # a block
  span inside
= wrap # a block without do
  span inside
ul
  - items.each_with_index # a loop without do
    li = items.first
- count = items.size # an assignment
p = count
- total = count \
  # alone on a continued line
p = total
p = "#{title} # inside a string"
p = "#not a comment"
= format(
    "%s and %s",
    "alice", # inside the call
    "bob",
  ) # after the call
~~~~~~~~ super_slim: lint
2: [UnescapedOutput] `==` skips HTML escaping: output with `=`, or render HTML from a translation key ending in `_html`
4: [HardcodedText] Translate `after a sibling` instead of writing it in the template
6: [HardcodedText] Translate `inside` instead of writing it in the template
8: [HardcodedText] Translate `inside` instead of writing it in the template
